Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.09,0:03:21.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(869.2,786.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}AKIHABARA
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,621)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oink It Up!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.4,768.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Starting Today, You're an Akiba Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't bear you not coming, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're 100% wool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please check us out, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounce on over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a maid cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moo, you like to come and rest for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real maid cafe girls! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm really\Nhere in Akiva! Hello, Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:04:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you bring this flyer in with you, you\Nwon't have to pay the service charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come check us out, Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely want to go. Meow.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1241.6,388.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1305.2,634.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1382,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This Building
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1407.6,830.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}2F
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(478.4,328.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(502.8,693.6)\fnPapyrus}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the pigsty, young mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Oink, but we're not open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the new maid starting\Nhere today, Nagomi Wahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the new girl. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:04:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing, can you\Ngo and change, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's so mature-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be so nice to\Nwork with such a pretty maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(621.2,317.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Nagomi Wahira,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(619.4,555.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}use this locker
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1248,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Manager
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed of\Nwearing a maid outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm Nagomi Wahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the live-in\Nposition at the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 17 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed of being a cute maid\Nworking in a cafe, so I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dream is really to be\Na maid in this day and age?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll manage fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The timing doesn't matter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that you're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're feeling right\Nnow, you should treasure that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see the other new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number 96, Runko Menon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,35 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're almost 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to hire a 35-year-old rookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her age shouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People can start over however many\Ntimes, as long as they're motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we'll have to do\Nour best with the four of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask this, but\Nwhat's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's our panda, Okachi-machi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okachi-a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never seen a panda? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cute, isn't it? Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an Akiba maid cafe, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you have to have a panda or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not usually, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zitzi-act, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty solid newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're going with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're pressed for\Ntime, so I'm gonna open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you two mysteriously\Ndisappear on me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll work really hard as\Nif my life depends on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.48,0:07:40.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(910.4,628.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Yumechi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is such a sweet surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing so many handsome\Nmasters sitting here before
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me fills a girl like me\Nup with so much happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be like her one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to give up being human then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's off on a whole other planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my personal recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, new girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you serve these oinky-doink\Ndrinks to our masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, will do right away, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super duper smooch. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please join me, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super duper smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you've got to\Npump things up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was super pumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky smooch, doinky\Nsmooch, oinky doink doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky smooch, doinky\Nsmooch, oinky doinky doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to nail\Nmy first task as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give up being\Nhuman, just like Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fresh out of Smoochie Ham Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm oinky-doink made Nogome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love eating wittle-bitty acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hobby is relaxing and\Nchatting with my good friend, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very half-picked to\Nmake your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink. Hey. Oink?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's read the manual properly, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us send you off, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will try even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't make trouble for my\Nregulars and you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I finally get to be a maid and\Nthere's no time to be discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the\Npigsty, please come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, perhaps this is your\Nfirst visit to the maid cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be\Nnervous about it, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I just started\Nas a maid today myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your oinky-doink water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drinking too much will turn you into\Na widow piglet, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you drink too much,\Nyou'll turn into a piglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I see you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe you're a little behind on\Ndelivering those party favors you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those do's aren't due now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you please give us a\Nlittle more time, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really not understand your\Nplace in this situation here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason swine-like\Nyou are in business is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of your affiliation\Nwith the Creatureland Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you truly understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then those words wouldn't be coming\Nout of your mouth, now would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very much aware of that, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me see you pinch out those do's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try squeezing harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't deliver the\Ngoods, I'll take that mate there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can be the one to handle\Nthe Wuv Wuv Moonbeam issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't have her do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She literally just joined our pen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to squeeze some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagomi, I'm going to need you\Nto do a very important job for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything for the cafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416,353.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.8,585.4)\fnPapyrus}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, I want you to go deliver\Nsomething to the Wuv Wuv Moonbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wuv Wuv Moonbeam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a maid cafe, one that happens to be\Nrun by our parent company's competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I want you to go over\Nthere and hand them this envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An envelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this\Nfor us, please? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate asking you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super sorry. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me accompany\Nher on this errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't think you should\Ntack along on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a good experience\Nfor the newbies to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you leave, you two should get\Nyourself something nice to eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pork broth ramen\Ndownstairs is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(675,358.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}RAMEN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, one soy milk tofu skin ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen, extra veggies, topped with\Nsauce, fat, and a load of garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same as ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi's oinky-doink drink is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really envy her skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess she has a special\Nway of infusing it with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to try harder so I\Ncan be of use to the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's really amazing\Nthat you're a maid at 35, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duly received you think they'll make it\Nback safely who cares if they do they
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both majorly suck as maids whoa that's\Ncold dude hey do you two believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miracles miracles yeah miracles I can see
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it a future where those two are smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wallowing around like cute piglets Then\Nwhy are you making a new hire flyer?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.69,0:14:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(484.8,524.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Urgently hiring new maids!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.66,0:14:55.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(611.2,222)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(868.8,596)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Hop on over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(761.4,545.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Five more hops
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to speak, number 96.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Ronko Manon from Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagomi Wahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here on an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me check and see if\Nmy manager is available.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently their theme\Nis rabbits on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hop on in and wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
