Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go me You need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I moved all of your stuff into your room
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My room fourth floor at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.22,0:23:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't sign up for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.30,0:23:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no other rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so for now I'm supposed to be sharing\Nthese living quarters with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to a long relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May we forever work well together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.

